{"qid": "tt_t3_00005", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 34.69, "n_tokens": 234, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.36, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 352, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "《收养法》已经失效，不能再作为起诉状的现行法律依据引用。\n\n**失效时间与替代法律**\n\n- 《中华人民共和国收养法》于 **2020年5月28日** 由第十三届全国人民代表大会第三次会议通过的《中华人民共和国民法典》废止，自 **2021年1月1日** 起失效。\n- 收养相关事项现由 **《中华人民共和国民法典》第五编\"婚姻家庭\"第五章\"收养\"** 规定，具体为 **第一千零九十三条至第一千一百一十八条**。\n\n**起诉状中的正确写法**\n\n- 涉及2021年1月1日之后发生的收养关系、收养登记、解除收养等争议，应引用《民法典》相应条文，例如：\n  - 收养关系成立条件：**《民法典》第一千零九十三条、第一千零九十四条、第一千零九十八条**\n  - 收养登记：**《民法典》第一千一百零五条**", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.033, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）闽01民再1746号_1", "score": 0.0682, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）闽01民再1746号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民初1222号_1", "score": 0.0682, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）川01民初1222号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）粤01民再1401号_1", "score": 0.0682, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）粤01民再1401号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）渝01民再2817号_1", "score": 0.0682, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）渝01民再2817号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）粤01民初2774号_1", "score": 0.0682, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）粤01民初2774号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）鲁01民终1299号_1", "score": 0.0682, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": n