{"qid": "tt_t3_00011", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 39.29, "n_tokens": 223, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["担保法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.28, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 335, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['担保法'] tvc=0", "answer": "《担保法》目前已不再作为独立法律有效，不能单独作为裁判依据。理由如下：\n\n1. **《担保法》已被废止**\n   《中华人民共和国民法典》自2021年1月1日起施行，同时废止了包括《担保法》在内的九部法律（见《民法典》第一千二百六十条）。因此，2021年1月1日之后，《担保法》不再具有独立法律效力。\n\n2. **担保规则已并入《民法典》**\n   原《担保法》的内容主要被《民法典》第三编第十三章\"保证合同\"、物权编\"担保物权\"部分吸收。例如，保证方式的规定现见于《民法典》第六百八十六条：保证的方式包括一般保证和连带责任保证。\n\n3. **裁判依据的适用规则**\n   - 对于2021年1月1日之后发生的担保事实，应适用《民法典》相关规定。\n   - 对于2021", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.038, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_担保法_1995_16", "score": 0.6515, "type": "provision", "law": "担保法", "article": 16, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民初1222号_1", "score": -0.0123, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）川01民初1222号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）粤01民再1401号_1", "score": -0.0123, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）粤01民再1401号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）闽01民再1746号_1", "score": -0.0123, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）闽01民再1746号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）粤01民初2774号_1", "score": -0.0123, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）粤01民初2774号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）鲁01民再2995号_1", "score": -0.0123, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）鲁