{"qid": "tt_t3_00017", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 42.45, "n_tokens": 233, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["婚姻法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.24, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 350, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['婚姻法'] tvc=0", "answer": "《婚姻法》现已**失效**，不再单独有效。\n\n具体说明：\n\n1. **失效时间**：自 **2021年1月1日** 起，《中华人民共和国婚姻法》被废止。\n2. **废止依据**：依据 **《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千二百六十条**，该条明确规定《中华人民共和国婚姻法》等法律自民法典施行之日起废止。\n3. **现行依据**：原《婚姻法》调整的结婚、家庭关系、离婚等内容，现由 **《中华人民共和国民法典》第五编“婚姻家庭”**（第一千零四十条至第一千一百一十一条）承接规定。\n\n因此，现在处理婚姻家庭纠纷，应引用《民法典》婚姻家庭编的相关条文，而不再引用原《婚姻法》。\n\n补充提示：您提供的参考资料均为离婚纠纷判决书，未涉及《婚姻法》效力问题，上述结论依据的是《民法典》第一千二百六十条的明确规定。", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.041, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）津02民终665号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）津02民终665号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1494号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1494号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）闽01民初2553号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）闽01民初2553号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1471号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1471号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）闽01民初2411号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）闽01民初2411号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民终2135号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民终2135号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民初139号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民初139号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民终2927号_0", "score": 0.1429, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民终2927号"}]}}}
{"qid": "tt_t3_00023", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 35.96, "n_tokens": 236, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.32, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 355, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "《中华人民共和国合同法》已于 **2021年1月1日** 随《中华人民共和国民法典》施行而**废止**，不再是有效的现行法律，**不能单独作为现行裁判依据**引用。\n\n具体说明：\n\n1. **废止依据**：《民法典》第一千二百六十条明确规定，本法自2021年1月1日起施行，《中华人民共和国合同法》同时废止。\n\n2. **对起诉状的影响**：\n   - 若你的合同纠纷**发生在2021年1月1日之前**，根据《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》第一条，一般仍适用当时的法律（即《合同法》），此时可在起诉状中援引《合同法》相关条文，并说明适用旧法的理由。\n   - 若纠纷**发生在2021年1月1日之后**，则应援引《民法典》合同编的相关条文（如第四百六十四条以下、第五百零九条", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.035, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民终2058号_1", "score": 0.0887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民终2058号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民终2065号_1", "score": 0.0887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民终2065号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）粤03民再311号_1", "score": 0.0887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）粤03民再311号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民再411号_1", "score": 0.0887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民再411号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民再2502号_1", "score": 0.0887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民再2502号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民终931号_1", "score": 0.0887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民终931号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）渝01民终1790号_1", "score": 0.0887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）渝01民终1790号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）川01民终2849号_1", "score": 0.0887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）川01民终2849号"}]}}}
{"qid": "tt_t3_00029", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 34.74, "n_tokens": 212, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["侵权责任法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.24, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 318, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['侵权责任法'] tvc=0", "answer": "《侵权责任法》现已失效。\n\n该法于2009年12月26日通过，自2010年7月1日起施行。2020年5月28日通过的《中华人民共和国民法典》自2021年1月1日起施行，同时《侵权责任法》被废止（见《民法典》第一千二百六十条，该条列明《侵权责任法》等九部法律自《民法典》施行之日起废止）。\n\n原《侵权责任法》的内容主要被《民法典》第七编\"侵权责任\"（第一千一百六十四条至第一千二百五十八条）吸收和承继。因此，2021年1月1日之后发生的侵权纠纷，应适用《民法典》侵权责任编的相关规定；对于该日期之前发生的法律事实，则可能涉及旧法的适用问题（一般依《民法典》时间效力的相关规定处理）。\n\n需要说明的是，您提供的参考资料均为离婚纠纷判决书，与", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.034, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民初443号_1", "score": 0.0625, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民初443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏05民再2737号_1", "score": 0.0625, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏05民再2737号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民再413号_1", "score": 0.0625, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民再413号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民再1453号_1", "score": 0.0625, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民再1453号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民再2148号_1", "score": 0.0625, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民再2148号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民终1511号_1", "score": 0.0625, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民终1511号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤03民初1523号_1", "score": 0.0625, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤03民初1523号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民终1939号_1", "score": 0.0625, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）川01民终1939号"}]}}}
{"qid": "tt_t4_00005", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 45.66, "n_tokens": 243, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.381, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 365, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=溯及力判断 as_of=2018-11-30 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "结论：原则上应适用行为发生时的旧法（即当时有效的《合同法》等），而非《民法典》。依据是《民法典时间效力规定》所确立的“法不溯及既往”原则，具体规则如下。\n\n**一、基本规则：以法律事实发生时间为界**\n\n《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力规定》（以下简称《时间效力规定》）第一条规定：民法典施行前的法律事实引起的民事纠纷案件，适用当时的法律、司法解释的规定，但是法律、司法解释另有规定的除外。\n\n你方行为发生于2018-11-30，属于民法典施行前（民法典自2021-01-01施行）的法律事实，因此原则上适用当时的《合同法》等旧法。\n\n**二、例外：旧法无规定而民法典有规定时可适用民法典**\n\n《时间效力规定》第三条：民法典施行前的法律事实引起的民事纠纷案件，当时的法律、司法解释没有规定而民法典有规定的，", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.044, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民终2384号_0", "score": 0.6811, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民终2384号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_3", "score": 0.6787, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 3, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民初1902号_0", "score": 0.6718, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民初1902号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民再1989号_1", "score": 0.5474, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）津02民再1989号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）粤03民再249号_1", "score": 0.5474, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）粤03民再249号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民初139号_1", "score": 0.5428, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null